description: force the bundled Widevine CDM buildflag on
author: Olivier Tilloy <olivier.tilloy@canonical.com>
 Chromium 156's DIR_BUNDLED_WIDEVINE_CDM is a directory with manifest.json.
 Returning ~/.local/lib/libwidevinecdm.so from that key makes
 CreateCdmInfoFromWidevineDirectory fail. System directory search lives in
 chromium-extra-widevine-search-paths.patch. Keep BUNDLE_WIDEVINE_CDM so
 GetBundledWidevine() is compiled for non-Chrome brands.

--- a/third_party/widevine/cdm/BUILD.gn
+++ b/third_party/widevine/cdm/BUILD.gn
@@ -19,7 +19,7 @@
 
   flags = [
     "ENABLE_WIDEVINE=$enable_widevine",
-    "BUNDLE_WIDEVINE_CDM=$bundle_widevine_cdm",
+    "BUNDLE_WIDEVINE_CDM=true",
     "ENABLE_WIDEVINE_CDM_COMPONENT=$enable_widevine_cdm_component",
   ]
 }
